  «text (2550,3150) 1 7 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿.func sgn(x) tanh(1000*x) "»
  «text (5700,3450) 1 7 0 0x1000000 -1 -1 "ï»¿.param L=60Âµ C=27.3n Cf=330Âµ R=0.48"»
